    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Choice of adjoining-part denominator can change relative-size conclusions.", "Ontogenetic series of known rudiments are sparse outside model organisms.";
